{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, יְדַע","hw":"יְדַע","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַע</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. know</strong> (v. BH);—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:21\" href=\"/Daniel.5.21\">Dn 5:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:11\" href=\"/Daniel.6.11\">6:11</a>, 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַ֫עְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:22\" href=\"/Daniel.5.22\">5:22</a>, 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִדְעֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">4:6</a>; Impf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּנְדַּע</span> (K<sup>§ 11, 4. b) δ</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:15\" href=\"/Ezra.4.15\">Ezr 4:15</a> +, etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּע</span> ms. (K<sup>§11, 3 α)</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:16\" href=\"/Daniel.6.16\">Dn 6:16</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">2:8</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽדְעִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">5:23</a>, etc.; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדִיעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:12\" href=\"/Ezra.4.12\">Ezr 4:12</a> +;—<em>know</em>, c. acc. rei <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">Dn 2:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:22\" href=\"/Daniel.5.22\">5:22</a>, acc. rei om. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:25\" href=\"/Ezra.7.25\">Ezr 7:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽדְעֵי דָּתֵי א׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:25\" href=\"/Daniel.5.25\">25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָֽדְעֵי בִינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:21\" href=\"/Daniel.2.21\">Dn 2:21</a>; c. obj. cl. v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:22\" href=\"/Daniel.2.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">4:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:14\" href=\"/Daniel.4.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:23\" href=\"/Daniel.4.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:29\" href=\"/Daniel.4.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:21\" href=\"/Daniel.5.21\">5:21</a>